abstract: "An Intelligent Driver Assistance System (ADAS) & Resilient Evacuation Navigation Platform engineered to safeguard vehicular mobility during extreme environmental catastrophes using YOLOv11s optical perception, Copernicus GLO-30 hydrological risk modeling, and sub-25ms evasive A* pathfinding."
